Passing Parameters to a Java Program

javac BuildingBlocks/Zoo.java
java BuildingBlocks.Zoo Bronx Zoo
The program correctly identifies the first two "words"

If you spaces inside an argument, you need to use quotes as in this example
java BuildingBlocks.Zoo "San Diego" Zoo

java BuildingBlocks.Zoo Zoo
Java prints out an exception telling you it has no idea qhat to do with this argument at position 1